suggestion:
将方法改为async Task，使用await替代.Result：
var riskList = await FollowUpServer.RunDelayRiskCheck(1, 0);
同时需要将GetCardList方法签名改为：public static async Task<...> GetCardList(...)

应该等待异步操作完成：
try {
    var cards = FollowUpServer.ResetWorkInfoCache(req.WorkId, req.GroupType);
    await MySocketHelper.NoticeAll(...);
} catch (Exception ex) {
    DingHelper.Push(...);
}
或者如果必须后台执行，使用Task.Run并处理异常：
Task.Run(async () => {
    try {
        await MySocketHelper.NoticeAll(...);
    } catch (Exception ex) {
        Logger.Error(ex, "Socket推送失败");
    }
});

使用参数化查询或IN子句参数化：
var ipList = RestartServerList.Select((item, index) => new { Index = index, Ip = item }).ToList();
var sql = $@"select count(1) from tb_ServerInfos where CpuUsage > @cpuUsage and IpTelecom in ({string.Join(",", ipList.Select((x, i) => $"@ip{i}"))})";
var parameters = new { cpuUsage }.ToDictionary();
foreach (var item in ipList) { parameters[$"ip{item.Index}"] = item.Ip; }

